{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50875","headline":"省题诗二十一首 边城晓角 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 边城晓角","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年抛故国，五夜在边城。\n月照沙千里，风吹角一声。\n清音飘远戍，残韵落荒营。\n背雪征鸿报，眠霜[老鹤惊]。\n李陵应下泪，蔡琰岂胜情。\n直是吴儿听，[乡关梦不成]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}